d White Ridebacks. The incident involves Kenji: by chance Rin and the journalist are near-by: she takes pictures while Rin tries to save her brother's life.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rFomAHgCjLgOGgcWRumnslQ96an.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"30987","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84576","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"77152","synopsis":"Kenji and Rin are in jail: he admitted to crimes he didn't commit to protect Rin. While being transferred to a GGP facility, Rin gets kidnapped by the BMA. Okakura goes to meet the BMA leader Kiefer. He's being followed by the GGP.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9GD2eSeUw5pxDknm36No7edGH5J.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Kenji and Rin are in jail: he admitted to crimes he didn't commit to protect Rin. While being transferred to a GGP facility, Rin gets kidnapped by the BMA. Okakura goes to meet the BMA leader Kiefer. He's being followed by the GGP.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9GD2eSeUw5pxDknm36No7edGH5J.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"30987","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84576","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"77151","synopsis":"The journalist investigates the legendary Arizona Battle. Kiefer and Rin have a long talk about life and riding. Finally the GGP starts the assault on the BMA's location, but the terrorists have already laid traps. Okakura escapes with Rin. After neutralising the attackers, Kiefer threatens to kill Romanov on the radio.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5yCRz0ZvpiLGlo3JmjAG09jzGni.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"The journalist investigates the legendary Arizona Battle. Kiefer and Rin have a long talk about life and riding. Finally the GGP starts the assault on the BMA's location, but the terrorists have already laid traps. Okakura escapes with Rin. After neutralising the attackers, Kiefer threatens to kill Romanov on the radio.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5yCRz0ZvpiLGlo3JmjAG09jzGni.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"30987","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84576","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"77153","synopsis":"GGP declares an emergency state causing resistance from civilians. Okakura brings Rin to the Takaoka's house and asks Tamayo to take care of her. He then goes to find Kiefer. The journalist goes to Arizona to investigate former comrades of Romanov. Tamayo calls her dad. Romanov unloads a new rideback weapon.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5yCRz0ZvpiLGlo3JmjAG09jzGni.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"GGP declares an emergency state causing resistance from civilians. Okakura brings Rin to the Takaoka's house and asks Tamayo to take care of her. He then goes to find Kiefer. The journalist goes to Arizona to investigate former comrades of Romanov. Tamayo calls her dad. Romanov unloads a new rideback weapon.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5yCRz0ZvpiLGlo3JmjAG09jzGni.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"30987","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"84576","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"77154","synopsis":"Tamayo's father is arrested. Tamayo and Rin head toward the city while an anti-GGP protest begins. While on the train, they see Suzuri who is mistaken for the mysterious female Rideback and is pursued by the GGP white rides. Suzuri is killed as she attempts to escape. A devastated Rin claims that both her and Tenshirō's obsession with Ridebacks killed Suzuri.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wwIcmHFPwEyNUDJjTiC2GUuL3mO.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Tamayo's father is arrested. Tamayo and Rin head toward the city while an anti-GGP protest begins. While on the train, they see Suzuri who is mistaken for the mysterious female Rideback and is pursued by the GGP white rides. Suzuri is killed as she attempts to escape. A devastated Rin claims that both her and Tenshirō's obsession with Ridebacks killed Suzuri.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wwIcmHFPwEyNUDJjTiC2GUuL3mO.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6235","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4618","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provide